Here is exactly what went wrong:
 * The 1-Minute Bug: You saw it said "Wait 5 minutes" but it fired every 1 minute. Why? Because SYSTIMESTAMP + 5 mins was adding 5 minutes in UTC, but your Scheduler checks the time in IST. Since UTC is 5.5 hours behind IST, the Scheduler thought the 5 minutes had already passed and picked it up instantly!
 * The Lock Bug (APPROVAL_LOCK_FAIL): We changed the batch status to 'Q' (Queued). But your VoucherCommandService only allows batches with status 'P' (Pending) to run! So it instantly rejected the retry.
 * The Stuck UI Bug: On the final 5th attempt, the system did send the final notification (your log shows NOTIFICATION_SENT at 16:17:37), but it forgot to update the UI Progress Bar! So your screen got stuck on "Attempt 1 of 5".
